  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "A distinctive and beautifully considered St Heliers residence offering approximately 260m² of living, exceptional harbour and Rangitoto views, and a sense of scale and architectural individuality rarely found in this sought-after location.\r\n\r\nReconstructed and re-clad in 2008 with cedar and a Sto cladding system with cavity, the home has also benefited from significant recent capital improvements, including a new roof, exterior recoating and new carpeting. These substantial works provide added confidence, allowing the next owner to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nDesigned to maximise light, space and its spectacular outlook, the residence features generous living and entertaining areas with seamless connection to the outdoors and sweeping harbour views.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights\r\n• Approximately 260m² of residence\r\n• Expansive harbour and Rangitoto views\r\n• 500m² private site\r\n• New roof\r\n• Recently recoated exterior\r\n• New carpeting\r\n• Two generous bedrooms\r\n• Two bathrooms\r\n• Two-car internal access garaging with workshop\r\n• Provision for a future elevator\r\n• Distinctive architectural design\r\n• Highly desirable St Heliers location\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity for buyers seeking substantial living, outstanding views and architectural character in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
